%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management APIs
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant YouthAPI as Youth Account API Service
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant TxnLedger as Transaction Ledger Service
    participant SettingsDB as Youth Account Settings DB
    participant TxnDB as Transaction DB

    %% Dashboard Retrieval
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & Request Dashboard
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: Forward request (RBAC)
    YouthAPI->>SettingsDB: Get spending limit
    YouthAPI->>TxnDB: Get recent transactions
    YouthAPI->>AccountSvc: Get account balance
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Dashboard data
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Dashboard data
    WebApp-->>Parent: Dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate Fund Transfer
    WebApp->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: Forward request (RBAC)
    YouthAPI->>PaymentSvc: Transfer funds
    PaymentSvc-->>YouthAPI: Transfer result
    YouthAPI->>AccountSvc: Update balances
    YouthAPI->>TxnDB: Log transaction
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Transfer response
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transfer response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Confirmation

    %% Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set Spending Limit
    WebApp->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: Forward request (RBAC)
    YouthAPI->>SettingsDB: Update limit
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Limit updated
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Limit updated
    WebApp-->>Parent: Confirmation

    %% Transaction History
    Parent->>WebApp: View Transactions
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: Forward request (RBAC)
    YouthAPI->>TxnDB: Fetch transactions
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Transaction list
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transaction list
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show history
